Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:13.85,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:20.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:27.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:32.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:40.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:46.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:53.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:01:00.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:08.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:13.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:21.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:27.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:28.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:34.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然政府通知的是不一樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.85,0:01:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然由佳吏長得不怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.89,0:01:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你們還是很般配的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們已經接過吻了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 那怎麼可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別那麼激動啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:47.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,爸爸和媽媽很早就接過吻了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接吻這種事試過一次懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們雙方都是初次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.49,0:01:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要好好練習哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.70,0:01:54.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就別操這心了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請問
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.21,0:02:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們為什麼要接 接 親吻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.21,0:02:05.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,順其自然地就...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:08.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那當然是因為喜歡了 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:10.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在也喜歡呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:12.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為喜歡接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:13.28,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子他爸真是的 瞎說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.27,0:02:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,厚勞省的人要晚點才會過來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們就在房間裡等等怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.11,0:02:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 不是那邊 那邊是浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.02,0:02:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:30.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.54,0:02:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 你家走廊裡太熱了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:45.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要好好做一下通風否則的話對地板不好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.88,0:02:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的房間在二樓吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,趕緊上來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.05,0:02:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好亂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這房間是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.34,0:02:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底是怎麼樣才會變成這個樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今早本來打算收拾一下的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.39,0:03:03.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,結果收拾的時候找到了古墳的書讀了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,算了反正還有時間 就幫你收拾一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是看不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這撿垃圾一樣的姿勢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.49,0:03:17.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,終於收拾好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:18.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 我的房間裡居然會有女孩子來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得好神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:27.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能是心理作用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:29.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總覺得房間裡瀰漫著好聞的味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎 怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個能讓我看看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.76,0:03:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲好可愛啊 好稚嫩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.81,0:03:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是因為這是小學生的畢業相冊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是沒有什麼變化的話才可怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這張照片是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:49.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是在林間學校的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:54.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的表情好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.61,0:03:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,髮型也很前衛呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.06,0:03:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只有這一張照片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為我沒什麼存在感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其實我撒謊了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其實這是因為把後面的高崎同學拍進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.54,0:04:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才把它買回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.59,0:04:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然竹田也入鏡了 但是這是我們唯一一張合照
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.47,0:04:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 你是什麼時候發現自己喜歡上了美咲的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.05,0:04:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都說是因為橡皮擦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.26,0:04:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是因為喜歡才想借給她橡皮擦的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是在把橡皮擦借給她的瞬間喜歡上的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.77,0:04:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概並不是那天喜歡上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是那天不管做什麼都好開心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺整個人都要飄起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:44.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且第二天 我看到了完全不一樣的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:48.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想一定就是那一瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學就成為了我心中特別的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時你就想和她接吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:04:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.01,0:04:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那時我還沒想到那麼多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.59,0:05:05.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是 我希望她能再一次對我展露笑顏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概 那是有生以來第一次遇到那麼開心的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好浪漫 好心動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心動...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:20.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈沒有遇到過這種事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即使沒有談過戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.37,0:05:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也有過心跳加速的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.08,0:05:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那大概是我十歲左右的時候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:37.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我住院了 父母又只能在下午來看望我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讓我有點寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後有一位年輕的見習醫生發現了我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就帶我去散步了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:46.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是對那醫生...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.27,0:05:47.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看到那邊的兒童人體模型了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那本來是親子一套的模型
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:05:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 因為這邊開設了兒科
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.91,0:06:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就只將兒童的模型送到了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:06.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以它因為太過寂寞 每晚都會偷偷哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:09.65,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以如果它的眼淚被別人看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.94,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個人半年不到就會的尿路結石
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:11.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣嗎 就像我一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從那以後 每次經過那人體模型的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都會心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在想想 那就是戀愛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.47,0:06:24.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不是 那就只是個恐怖故事而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,確實我並沒有多想和它接吻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟那是人體模型嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.36,0:06:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 你還得我說過的話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.07,0:06:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要你一天和美咲吻一次
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們接吻了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底怎麼樣啊 親了還是沒親
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟了 怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 瞞著她也不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:57.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,親 親了 我們接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.63,0:07:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這反應是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,預料之中 我完全沒感覺呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.64,0:07:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣啊 那真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲是不是很開心？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.77,0:07:15.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再多親幾次啊 我會幫你們的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲不開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.94,0:07:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.57,0:07:22.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也沒問過她的感想 不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我很開心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣 那太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:33.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了 莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.42,0:07:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 我 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.30,0:07:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼你要道歉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為你不是生氣了...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.43,0:07:45.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才沒生氣呢 別自以為是了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 他們來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚上好 我是厚生勞動省的一條
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:00.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是矢島
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就趕緊開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:03.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想你們已經聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:10.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們要做收到政府通知後的反饋調查
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.91,0:08:14.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們之間的氣氛好像不太對呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們剛剛是不是做了什麼羞羞的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種事很常見的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:21.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟政府通知的「姻緣」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被稱為「科學的紅線」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.51,0:08:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在做調查之前聊聊這個話題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:31.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說起科學的紅線
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.27,0:08:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其強大之處就在於壓倒性的情報量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:39.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人類性格中的百分之五十
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.15,0:08:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在遺傳分子階段就已經定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.19,0:08:45.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從你們進入小學到十五歲為止
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.95,0:08:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,應該經歷了無數次的問卷調查和對面談話
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如春季的體檢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和第二學期的道德課
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這些全都是影響政府通知的因素
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是影響著匹配的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而結果則會在16歲人格形成之前給出
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.84,0:09:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很久之前還殘留著相親和做媒的傳統
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而這些在政府通知的精確度面前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就彷彿是騙小孩的把戲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:21.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以科學為基礎的政府通知其失敗率非常之低
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:24.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,順便一提 政府通知的標準
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.65,0:09:27.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,與外表容貌幾乎無關
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.07,0:09:31.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到漂亮的女孩子就會想和她交往
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:35.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看到胸大的女孩子就會被吸引對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 根據分析
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是以外貌為標準而進行的婚姻失敗率卻很高
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:48.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也就是說人並不會因為外貌而戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這就是科學的結論
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼樣 姻緣制度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,意外地還挺浪漫的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.77,0:09:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了聽了這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:09:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們對彼此的想法是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對彼此的想法...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 請簡短地敘述一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,首先就從你開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然理論上我已經明白是怎麼回事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但感情上我還是不太能接受 我也不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這倒也是 你們認識還不到一個月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.30,0:10:30.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,理論我已經明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是如果要立刻套用到自己身上的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.76,0:10:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對我這個當事人來說還是太過模糊了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:41.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能否再向我們透露一些情報呢 比如指南書上...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我會將你們的意見作為參考傳達給上級的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.82,0:10:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 看起來你們的相性很好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接吻之類的應該也做過一兩次了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.37,0:10:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,速度比較快的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.50,0:11:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一個月就上床的情侶也有好幾成呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:04.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 反正將來也是要結婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們彼此之間可以更加深入瞭解一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.42,0:11:10.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.01,0:11:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,加 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.01,0:11:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和 和莉莉奈上床
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.43,0:11:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我絕對不干
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.14,0:11:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼我們先告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.69,0:11:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 根島由佳吏同學
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.02,0:11:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道高崎家住在哪裡嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.86,0:11:29.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下來我們要去那一家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是弄不清楚位置
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.78,0:11:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎 是高崎美咲的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 就是她家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.95,0:11:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎美咲的家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她家在第二小學後面的公園附近
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:45.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是在那邊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請問 美咲的政府通知來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,關於這件事我們無可奉告
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.01,0:11:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.22,0:11:54.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請告訴我對方是怎麼樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:57.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這屬於個人情報 請恕我不能告知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.35,0:12:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感謝你們的幫助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,祝你們有個好夢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.23,0:12:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高 高崎同學的政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也一直都喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.87,0:12:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是我 高崎同學要和別人...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,振作一點 由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還不一定是美咲的政府通知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有可能是她哥哥或者姐姐的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.76,0:12:35.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,據我所知高崎同學沒有哥哥姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已經完了 完了 完了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:44.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你對美咲的感情只有這種程度嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少我不這麼認為
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.23,0:12:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,否則我也不會幫你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.48,0:12:53.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只是因為政府通知就要放棄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果真是那樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:56.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就太讓我失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:07.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我不對 現在還不能放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是啊 你太沒有毅力了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.79,0:13:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對不起 還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明明你是我的政府通知對像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.30,0:13:16.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卻還要讓你說這些 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我並不是為了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是不想要美咲有悲傷的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.73,0:13:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,厚勞省的人已經回去了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.23,0:13:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那莉莉奈 可以借一步說話嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:32.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈聽家裡人說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下次你們家要和我們一起去露營
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.78,0:13:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:41.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你回家問問你媽媽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.49,0:13:42.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.12,0:13:51.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,明天到學校要好好找美咲問清楚政府通知的事哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.30,0:13:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後再跟美咲接吻吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.42,0:13:58.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別管什麼政府通知了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:02.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不會再和高崎同學接吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:05.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算是莉莉奈叫我們接吻 果然還是太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:21.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得這個不允許和喜歡的人接吻的世界才更奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:27.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.87,0:14:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲居然會踩點到 真是少見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.54,0:14:33.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一不小心 一不小心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.55,0:14:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 你看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:44.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,第六節課都上完了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.39,0:14:45.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我到底在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,選舉管理員留下來製作小冊子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.44,0:14:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 選舉管理員是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.52,0:14:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學和木村同學
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.32,0:14:55.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是今天木村同學請假了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎一個人的話恐怕不行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.74,0:15:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,誰來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.07,0:15:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島 你放學後有空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:08.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就拜託高崎和根島了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學是在教室嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能和她好好談談就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.01,0:15:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你到底想說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:27.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學和仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:30.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.52,0:15:31.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我當然明白啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.40,0:15:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼 他們在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.87,0:15:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 來晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:49.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.37,0:15:56.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛剛她和仁阪都說了些什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.79,0:15:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我先折一下再給你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能幫我把它們一張張夾好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.97,0:16:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學臉上看不見毛孔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮膚光滑又清爽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.52,0:16:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不對
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那 那個高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.48,0:16:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨天厚勞省的人去你家了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:26.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.70,0:16:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.04,0:16:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.50,0:16:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對啊 稍微安心點了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 那是個怎麼樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什麼樣 的我覺得還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,應該可以好好相處
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已經見過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.31,0:16:51.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,見過啊 我們住在一起哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.19,0:16:59.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學不是收到了政府通知嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,才不是 政府通知才沒來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.78,0:17:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是昨天厚勞省的人不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.16,0:17:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個只是到我家有點事而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.33,0:17:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我完全沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那到底是什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比起這個厚勞省的人為什麼去了根島的家裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是問我收到政府通知之後的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.01,0:17:26.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以問問你是怎麼回答的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.30,0:17:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就只是回答 我自己也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.68,0:17:33.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,事實也是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得根島同學和莉莉挺合適的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:42.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:45.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但總覺得你們有些相似的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是都會為了某人而努力之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.99,0:17:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是莉莉更加強勢 冒失
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,的確
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:18:00.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昨天 我聽說厚勞省的人要去高崎同學的家裡時
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我非常混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後莉莉奈就非常生氣地對我說 振作點
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 那個是鼓勵我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 她狠狠的拍了我的臉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:15.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉果然很厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.72,0:18:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我根本比不上她呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:22.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總有一天高崎同學的政府通知也會來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.69,0:18:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對方會是怎麼樣的人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.74,0:18:29.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是怎樣的人都不重要吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.32,0:18:33.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對我來說只有根島同學是特別的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.74,0:18:36.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管對方是誰都一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我又做了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.99,0:19:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一臉不高興 發生什麼事了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.41,0:19:16.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.45,0:19:17.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看來是有事了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲從以前開始就喜歡撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我啊 認為有些東西是不惜撒謊也要保護的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.05,0:19:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可是 我卻無論如何也沒法對自己的心撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謊言是瞞不過自己的心的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.68,0:19:43.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,戀愛的話肯定更是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:00.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.12,0:20:03.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了 你居然會給我打電話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.67,0:20:05.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還不是你不跟我聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你和美咲談過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 抱歉 我問過她了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.51,0:20:11.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然後呢 美咲怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她說不是政府通知的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:17.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那為什麼厚勞省的人會...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.43,0:20:19.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個我沒問
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 那算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:25.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說 昨天阿姨說的露營的事你聽說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.94,0:20:27.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 大概聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.73,0:20:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也邀請了美咲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她說她會來的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.86,0:20:35.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩個人一起來我絕對會抬不起頭的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:42.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我也可以邀請我的朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.54,0:20:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,求你啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我為什麼要和你去露營啊 莫名其妙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不會點火
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不會
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:57.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我還怕蟲子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.85,0:21:00.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也怕啊 看到蟋蟀我就會嚇哭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.68,0:21:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是遇到熊的話我肯定打不過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.56,0:21:06.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你為什麼認為我就能打贏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.44,0:21:08.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,長相？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在吃飯你去一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你說什麼我都答應
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是這樣 拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.07,0:21:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說你啊 對別人也是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣活著不累嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只對仁阪你才這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.70,0:21:24.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我要三個草莓大福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.09,0:21:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太好了 謝謝你 仁阪 幫大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.55,0:21:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,否則的話夾在高崎同學和莉莉奈中間
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.63,0:21:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一個人根本沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和根島同學去露營 我該高興嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.82,0:22:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果 全都是謊言就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:26.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.11,0:22:28.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:30.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:33.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:39.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.86,0:22:42.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:45.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:51.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.57,0:22:55.53,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:58.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:04.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.71,0:23:06.54,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:13.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:18.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:33.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.55,0:23:37.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早上好 阿基
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.50,0:23:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,早
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.09,0:23:39.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中午吃什麼呢 阿基
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.38,0:23:42.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,辛苦了 明天也拜託你了 阿基
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.84,0:23:44.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 生命攸關的戀愛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.22,0:00:13.85,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:20.19,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:27.16,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:32.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:40.13,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.81,0:00:46.84,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:53.49,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.23,0:01:00.73,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.52,0:01:08.36,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:13.95,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:21.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.68,0:01:27.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.39,0:01:28.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.33,0:22:26.11,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:30.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.00,0:22:35.29,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.29,0:22:37.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.72,0:22:39.86,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.57,0:22:51.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:58.38,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:04.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:09.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:13.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:15.70,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:18.30,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:33.85,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
